    {
      "file": "docs/USER_GUIDE_EN.md",
      "line": 84,
      "text": "OBSIDIAN 0.20.0 preserves existing `sentinel.db` history in place. New installs use the OBSIDIAN state folder; an existing legacy state folder takes precedence. Select **Stop Scan** to request cancellation. Native collection stops before the next request; an optional scanner already running may finish its bounded operation first. HTTP 429/503 stops further native collection. See `OBSIDIAN_AUDIT.md",
